<title>JAPAN: Japanese net foreign bond buyers in January--MOF.</title>
<headline>Japanese net foreign bond buyers in January--MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net purchases of foreign bonds by Japanese investors totalled 502.8 billion yen in January, down from net purchases of 1.3466 trillion yen a month earlier, the Ministry of Finance (MOF) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Bonds include beneficiary certificates but exclude all bills.</p>
<p>Net selling of Japanese stocks by foreign investors amounted to 10.8 billion yen in January compared with net purchases of 294.1 billion yen in the previous month, the ministry said.  </p>
<p>Details of Japanese and foreigners' investments in billions</p>
<p>of yen, were as follows:</p>
<p>JAPANESE INVESTMENT</p>
<p> Foreign stocks: Net	     Foreign bonds: Net</p>
<p> January    -131.1	     January	+502.8</p>
<p> December   +179.6	     December   +1,346.6</p>
<p>FOREIGNERS' INVESTMENT</p>
<p> Japanese stocks: Net	    Japanese bonds: Net</p>
<p> January     -10.8	     January	+367.6</p>
<p> December   +294.1	     December     -121.0</p>
<p>Figures are rounded and based on settlements.</p>
</text>
